Kroger's operating profit for fiscal 2023 (the year ended February 3, 2024) was $3.1 billion, or 2.06% of sales [1], and the filing's reconciliation table gives the exact figure as $3,096 million [2]. That compares with $4.1 billion, or 2.78% of sales, in 2022. [1]

Note that fiscal 2023 was a 53-week year. The ROIC reconciliation labels the $3,096 million as being on a 53-week basis, and it shows an Extra Week operating profit adjustment of $(187) million. [3]